  "visual_observation": {
    "observed_identity": "Adult stocky sand-colored armadillo guardian. Exact long narrow animal snout, upright large armadillo ears, small dark eyes, heavy overlapping ochre/golden segmented shell on shoulders and back, cream layered belly, thick ochre leather/armored forearm guards and dark fingerless fists, dark-teal tied waist sash with long gold-trimmed cloth panels, dark-teal ankle wraps, large clawed feet and short tapering plated tail.",
    "anatomy": "Preserve the exact overlapping shell plates and their body attachment, shell thickness, snout length, ear shape, claws, tail length and low broad posture. Natural shoulder-elbow-wrist connections under the armor; the shell moves with torso rotation and does not become a floating shield. No new armor, helmet, scales replacing shell, horns, jewels or changed costume.",
    "transform": "Transformation uses only a firmer braced stance and subtly brighter warm highlights along EXISTING shell edges. The same plates, belly, eyes, ears, sash and tail remain unchanged; no glowing chest core, new seams, spikes, giant armor or external aura."
  },
